<title>SOUTH KOREA: Soccer-Results of South Korean pro-soccer games.</title>
<headline>Soccer-Results of South Korean pro-soccer games.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of South Korean pro-soccer games played on Thursday.</p>
<p>    Puchon	3    Anyang	2   (halftime 2-1)</p>
<p>Standings after games played on Thursday (Tabulate under -</p>
<p>won, drawn, lost, goals for, goals against, points):</p>
<p>			    W     D    L    G/F   G/A    P</p>
<p>    Puchon		5     1    1    12     6    16</p>
<p>    Chonan		4     1    1    16    13    13</p>
<p>    Chonnam	     3     3    1    10     7    12</p>
<p>    Suwon		 2     4    0     8     3    10</p>
<p>    Chonan		3     1    2    16    14    10</p>
<p>    Anyang		1     4    2    12    14     7</p>
<p>    Ulsan		 2     0    5    13    16     6</p>
<p>    Chonbuk	     1     1    5     6    12     4</p>
<p>    Pusan		 0     3    4     8    16     3</p>
